    {
      "example": "2019-10-04T00:00:00Z",
      "help_en": "The start of the time range to query.\n\nSpecify the time in the ISO 8601 standard in the yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ssZ format. The time must be in UTC.\n\nIf you want to query data of a specific day, we recommend that you set the value in the yyyy-MM-ddT16:00:00Z format",
      "help_zh": "开始获取数据的时间点。\n\n日期格式按照ISO8601表示法，并使用UTC时间，格式为yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ssZ。\n\n查询某天的数据，建议传参格式为yyyy-MM-ddT16:00:00Z",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "start_time",
      "options": [
        "--start-time"
      ],
      "raw_name": "StartTime",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "2019-10-04T16:00:00Z",
      "help_en": "The end of the time range to query.\n\nSpecify the time in the ISO 8601 standard in the yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ssZ format. The time must be in UTC.\n\nThe end time must be later than the start time. The maximum time range that can be specified is seven days",
      "help_zh": "获取数据结束时间点。\n\n日期格式按照ISO8601表示法，并使用UTC时间，格式为yyyy-MM-ddTHH:mm:ssZ。\n\n结束时间需大于开始时间，并且结束时间和开始时间相差不超过7天",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "end_time",
      "options": [
        "--end-time"
      ],
      "raw_name": "EndTime",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "pv",
      "help_en": "The method that is used to sort the returned URLs. Default value: pv. Valid values:\n\ntraf: by network traffic\npv: by the number of page views",
      "help_zh": "排序方式，默认值为pv。取值：\n\ntraf：流量。\n\npv：访问量",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "sort_by",
      "options": [
        "--sort-by"
      ],
      "raw_name": "SortBy",
      "required": false,
